Fix namespace case mismatch in ai_automators AiCKEditor plugin (drupal/ai 1.4.3).

Directory is src/Plugin/AiCKEditor/ but the file declares Plugin\AICKEditor.
On case-insensitive filesystems Symfony DebugClassLoader throws
"Case mismatch between loaded and declared class names"; on case-sensitive
production the class silently fails to load. Re-check on next drupal/ai update.

--- a/modules/ai_automators/src/Plugin/AiCKEditor/AiAutomatorsCKEditor.php
+++ b/modules/ai_automators/src/Plugin/AiCKEditor/AiAutomatorsCKEditor.php
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 <?php

-namespace Drupal\ai_automators\Plugin\AICKEditor;
+namespace Drupal\ai_automators\Plugin\AiCKEditor;

 use Drupal\Core\Ajax\AjaxResponse;
 use Drupal\Core\Ajax\InvokeCommand;
